From 705948ce03ff56a74645fb8c46ffc0806883027d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 14sea <14sea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:42:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] software_isp, ipa: simple: contrast detection autofocus

Sharpness statistics (squared differences of same-colour neighbours in the
centre ninth) from SwStatsCpu, an Af algorithm in the simple IPA that scans
the focus lens coarse then fine and rescans on scene changes (continuous by
default), and the simple pipeline moving the sensor's focus lens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
